replay-theater
Based on replay-theater from anthropics/claude-code-playground, Copyright 2026 Anthropic PBC, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Source: https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-playground/tree/main/claude-code/mods/replay-theater

Modified by MrRoco. Changes, 20-11-2026:

- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: added a "Modified by" line under the original copyright header.
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: fixed colour names replaced by theme colour names: border, title,
  hint and active step use "claude" (was magenta / cyan), added lines and +N use "success"
  (was green), removed lines and -N use "error" (was red); the file path is drawn in the
  default colour (was cyan).
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: the deprecated "bold" text prop replaced by weight "bold".
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: own texts: pane title "Replay", heading "▶ Replay", step
  "edit N of M", empty "The last turn made no file edits.", notes "all occurrences",
  "change N of M" and "whole file", hint "▶ N file edits in the last turn", button
  "◀ Previous", command description "Step through the last turn's file edits", replies
  "Replaying N edits." / "The last turn made no file edits.".
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: the tool.call hook is matched on Edit, Write and MultiEdit
  (MultiEdit by pattern, as the 2.1.328 tool types no longer list it) instead of filtering a
  matcher-less hook; the tool name set was removed.
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: edits made by subagents (tool calls with an agentId) are no longer
  recorded; the replay covers the main turn only.
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: .catch handlers that pass the event on added to the gating
  tool.call and ui.close hooks.
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: the ui.close hook checks only the event's id (dropped a requestId
  check on a field that event does not have).
- hooks/replay-theater.mjs: JSDoc types for the module state and the register function, so
  the file type-checks against the Claude Code types.
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json: own description, author MrRoco, license Apache-2.0.
- README.md: replaced by an own README describing this modified copy.
- tests/replay-theater.test.ts: added.
- LICENSE: copied from the root of anthropics/claude-code-playground.
- NOTICE: added.
- Screenshots of the original were not copied.
